       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      *
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI60302         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV6030.
       COPY SWCV6031.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *01  SW-SWITCH.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.
           05 CON-DEBITO                  PIC  X(01) VALUE 'D'.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-MONTANTE                 PIC  ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ9,99.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI60302'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                         PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI60302         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV6030-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6030-ASE               TO SWCV6031-ASE.
           MOVE SWCV6030-ADE               TO SWCV6031-ADE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV6030-IDRECON           TO SWCV6031-IDRECON.
      *
           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
                 THRU 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-APRESENTA-DADOS'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV6030-IDRECON           TO SWCV6031-IDRECON.
           MOVE SWCV6030-COSN              TO SWCV6031-COSN .
           MOVE SWCV6030-COSNC             TO SWCV6031-COSNC .
           MOVE SWCV6030-MRNOPR            TO SWCV6031-MRNOPR .
           MOVE SWCV6030-MRNORD            TO SWCV6031-MRNORD .
PML        MOVE SWCV6030-DATAOPE           TO SWCV6031-DATAOPE.
