       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6031-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV6031-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6031-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
      *
       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
